<title>THAILAND: Banpu announces interim H2 div payment.</title>
<headline>Banpu announces interim H2 div payment.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banpu Plc said on Friday that the company's board of directors resolved to pay an interim dividend as follows:</p>
<p>		 Six months ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  3.50    vs    3.50</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 March 17, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	March 31, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Banpu Plc is an energy firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-2529950)</p>
</text>
